commends scheduling frequent rest breaks\nin shaded or air conditioned environments. Anyone overcome by\nheat should be moved to a cool and shaded location. Heat stroke\nis an emergency! Call 9 1 1.", "response": "Execute", "note": null, "parameters": {"AWIPSidentifier": ["NPWPAH"], "WMOidentifier": ["WWUS73 KPAH 270532"], "NWSheadline": ["EXTREME HEAT WARNING REMAINS IN EFFECT UNTIL 7 PM CDT TUESDAY"], "BLOCKCHANNEL": ["EAS", "NWEM", "CMAS"], "VTEC": ["/O.CON.KPAH.XH.W.0003.000000T0000Z-260729T0000Z/"], "eventEndingTime": ["2026-07-28T19:00:00-05:00"], "expiredReferences": ["w-nws.webmaster@noaa.gov,urn:oid:2.49.0.1.840.0.df9712683b7d3f805723bd67a83bc869a8d66525.001.2,2026-07-26T00:14:00-05:00 w-nws.webmaster@noaa.gov,urn:oid:2.49.0.1.840.0.aaebafb386bdb738cc1c2302e3699467c97868b4.001.1,2026-07-25T23:44:00-05:00 w-nws.webmaster@noaa.gov,urn:oid:2.49.0.1.840.0.1f973a664d311d7fa16866685425295e6f08cdb8.001.2,2026-07-25T23:30:00-05:00"]}, "scope": "Public", "code": "IPAWSv1.0", "language": "en-US", "web": "http://www.weather.gov", "eventCode": {"SAME": ["NWS"], "NationalWeatherService": ["XHW"]}}}], "title": "Current watches, warnings, and advisories for Jackson (ILZ084) IL", "updated": "2026-07-27T13:35:43+00:00"}